{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想告別逐筆手動輸入銀行月結單的繁瑣工序，JetRise StatementSnap 能把 PDF 或 CSV 格式的月結單自動整理成清晰有序的財務數據，特別適合需要管理個人開支、核對信用卡帳目或準備報稅的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自動讀取月結單並分類</h2>\n<p>StatementSnap 可直接讀取 PDF 或 CSV 格式的銀行及信用卡月結單，自動抽取每筆交易的日期、商戶、金額與分類，毋須逐項手動輸入。匯入後，總覽看板即時顯示淨現金流、收入與支出，交易帳本提供自動分類與搜尋篩選，並以圖表列出各分類佔比與主要商戶排行，另支援一鍵匯出 Excel。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-25-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-26-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-27-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-28-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1206x2622bb-29-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：JetRise StatementSnap</li>\n<li>應用類別：Finance</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T22:19:00.374420+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":336,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T22:09:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T23:37:43.320793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T22:17:38.329970+00:00","content_hash":"5bc47453fe052c22fc5e0b19835cf0763e9fae7d2f8f467acf33863ee04a9afb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}